published the first randomised controlled trial in humans in 1972 and many others followed.ObjectivesTo assess the 
effects of administering a course of corticosteroids to the mother prior to anticipated preterm birth on fetal and 
neonatal morbidity and mortality, maternal mortality and morbidity, and on the child in later 
