Twelve patients were randomized to receive indomethacin and twelve patients were randomized to receive magnesium 
sulfate. Twenty-one fetuses underwent cerebral Doppler studies in triplicate during and after therapy. The mean 
gestational age at tocolysis was 27.5 +/- 1.9 weeks for the indomethacin group and 26.4 +/- 1.6 weeks for the magnesium 
