│ mortality was concerned."}, {"study_index": 49, "title": "Post‐neonatal mortality, morbidity, and developmental      │
│ outcome after ultrasound‐dated preterm birth in rural Malawi: a community‐based cohort study", "abstract":           │
│ "BACKGROUND Preterm birth is considered to be associated with an estimated 27% of neonatal deaths, the majority in   │
